		(at 20 62)
		(descr "GOOUUU ESP32-S3-CAM socket, 2x20 at 2.54 mm, rows 25.4 mm apart - measured on the board and confirmed against a published figure. Pin 1 = 3V3 at top left seen from above with the two USB-C on the bottom edge; the silkscreen bar marks that edge. The outline is deliberately oversized: this board has no datasheet, so its real edge is unmeasured and the courtyard errs wide to keep tall parts out from under it. Keep the USB edge clear for cables, and EN and BOOT reachable on the top face.")
